WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.230
Speaker 1: Let's go next to Daniel from Taiwan.

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:05.230
Daniel, welcome.

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:08.389
Speaker 4: Hey, David, how are you?

00:00:08.389 --> 00:00:10.370
I'm doing well.

00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:20.210
I was just I mean, what would you tell somebody
that's in Taiwan that's increasingly maybe

00:00:20.210 --> 00:00:26.569
concerned about being invaded by an authoritarian
regime that shall not be named?

00:00:26.569 --> 00:00:30.009
Speaker 1: Yeah, I would be.

00:00:30.009 --> 00:00:38.780
I would be very, very much sensitive to what
what may become a precarious situation.

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:44.000
I mean, listen, I said weeks ago, I think
China's paying attention to what's happening

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.280
in Russia and Ukraine to see what is Russia
allowed to get away with.

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:53.200
And as a result, what might China be allowed
to get away with when it comes to Taiwan?

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:54.200
I am.

00:00:54.200 --> 00:01:00.059
I don't want to say I'm expecting aggression,
but I am.

00:01:00.059 --> 00:01:04.250
Thinking it's quite plausible that there will
be aggression towards Taiwan from China, so

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:08.970
I don't know, I mean, I would I would be paying
attention to what local government is saying.

00:01:08.970 --> 00:01:15.190
Speaker 4: Yeah, I mean, there's I mean, there's
a couple of things that I'd like to say about

00:01:15.190 --> 00:01:16.190
this.

00:01:16.190 --> 00:01:18.120
I did send you an email about this, I wrote.

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:22.330
I mean, I'm sure you get a lot of emails,
so it's probably just lost in the weeds there.

00:01:22.330 --> 00:01:31.490
But I don't like the I don't like the fact
that China gets to have their, you know, state

00:01:31.490 --> 00:01:38.410
run media and propaganda channels on Western
social media like Facebook, Twitter, Instagram.

00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:45.030
They have, you know, plenty of YouTube channels
just spreading their propaganda.

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:50.540
And you know, I just checked on Facebook,
only one of their state run media channels,

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:58.000
just one they have many and just one has over
a million and 100 million followers on Facebook.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:01:59.000
Hmm.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:01.980
And and obviously.

00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:05.840
They're not allowed to have, you know, any
media channels that they don't approve of

00:02:05.840 --> 00:02:06.840
over there.

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:11.370
So I just see that as like this unfair balance
to where they get to very successfully spread

00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:16.060
the propaganda outside their borders, but
not the other way or not received the other

00:02:16.060 --> 00:02:17.060
way around.

00:02:17.060 --> 00:02:18.130
That's a fair criticism.

00:02:18.130 --> 00:02:19.200
Yeah.

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:23.370
And it really it really affects the conversation
publicly.

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:26.610
And I just don't I just don't like that.

00:02:26.610 --> 00:02:27.840
I don't want to take up too much time.

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:32.880
But I also just like to say that the People's
Republic of China, which is their official

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:41.120
name, has never governed Taiwan in any century,
decade, year, month, week, day, hour, minute,

00:02:41.120 --> 00:02:42.340
second in history.

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:44.900
It's never happened before.

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:50.320
And I would I send you an email suggesting
an expert on the topic they maybe have on

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:51.320
the show?

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:52.320
Speaker 1: OK.

00:02:52.320 --> 00:02:53.710
All right, Daniel from Taiwan.

00:02:53.710 --> 00:02:54.710
Thank you.

00:02:54.710 --> 00:02:57.900
You've said it all.

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:16.840
Correction Wolf Blitzer reported extensively
from Ashkelon, but he was actually born in

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:17.840
Germany.

00:03:17.840 --> 00:04:02.640
So I want to make sure that I clarify that
just in the interest of clarity this evening.

